    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="main-content">
        <h2>SOUTHWESTERN ONTARIO GLIDING ASSOCIATION</h2>
        <img src="soga mountain logo.jpg" alt="SOGA Logo" width="200" height="73">
        <p><img src="DSCF0009a.jpg" alt="Image"></p>
        <p class="blue-text">You've come this far. Why not join up. See below for all our contact information.</p>
        <p class="blue-text underline">E-Mail Address:</p>
        You can contact Kevin Thomson for all your enquiries at <a href="mailto: soga@bell.net" class="blue-text">soga@bell.net</a>

        <p class="blue-text underline">Operations Address:</p>
        ( New location as of October 2018 )

        <p class="blue-text underline">New Location:</p>
        195329 Amaranth East Luther Townline, Amaranth, Ontario.<br>
        GPS Coordinates: N 44.017194, W -80.327903

        <p class="blue-text underline">General Location:</p>
        About 12 km west south-west of Shelburne, Ontario

        <p class="blue-text underline">Directions:</p>
        Just put it into your GPS. :-)

        <p>If you are planning to come visit us at our field, be sure to check if we are flying.</p>
        <p>Flying days are usually listed in the EVENTS section on our public <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/soga.hg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Face Book page.</a></p>

        <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d298.40888402058613!2d-80.3289922039968!3d44.017087300000014!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x882a4d78f9445d77%3A0x6afbc14e7a4728e5!2sSOGA!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sca!4v1622341422396!5m2!1sen!2sca"
        width="600" height="450" loading="lazy"></iframe>

        <p>If you are brand new to the concept of hang gliding and want to get involved, or, if you just want more information, here is a short list of hang gliding training schools:</p>

        <p><a href="https://instinct.pro/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instinct Windsports</a> is near Kitchener Ontario</p>

        <p><a href="https://www.hpac.ca/schools-and-certified-instructors/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> HPAC listed schools</a> List of schools approved by HPAC </p>

        <p>If you are a hang glider pilot and want to get your aerotow rating, then drop us a line at <a href="mailto:soga@bell.net" class="blue-text">soga@bell.net</a></p>

        <p>So take some time to peruse this website, and you can always find us on our public Face Book page.</p>

        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/soga.hg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="FBimage012 120.jpg" alt="Facebook Logo" width="120" height="39">
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.hpac.ca/pub/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <img src="HPAC logo 1.jpg" alt="HPAC Logo" width="70" height="67">
        </a>

        <p class="blue-text">Southwestern Ontario Gliding Association is a not-for-profit corporation registered in the province of Ontario, Canada</p>
    </div>
